    <bpmn:process id="W_W5076" name="W5076. Cylinder-Asset, Deposit &amp; Float Reconciliation &amp; Audit" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Monthly reconciliation; audit cycle (VS-21); financial close (VS-17)
Frequency: Monthly + audit cycle
Volume: ~10,000s pool cylinders + deposit-float GL
Owner: Inventory/Fixed-Asset/O2C (VS-05/VS-35/VS-16) / Finance
Participants: Inventory (VS-05), Fixed-Asset (VS-35), O2C (VS-16), FP&amp;A (VS-17.4), Internal Audit (VS-21), Supplier (VS-03)
Source: workflow W5076 — Cylinder-Asset, Deposit &amp; Float Reconciliation &amp; Audit</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5076_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5076_Lane1" name="Inventory">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5076_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5076_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5076_Lane2" name="O2C">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5076_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5076_Lane3" name="Internal Audit">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5076_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5076_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5076_Start5" name="Monthly reconciliation; audit cycle (VS-21); financial close (VS-17)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5076_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5076_Task6" name="Reconcile the cylinder pool: total cylinders…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Reconcile the cylinder pool: total cylinders (full/empty/quarantined/condemned/in-transit) vs the asset register (VS-35/VS-111), supplier-owned vs BuildRight-owned split, and reconcile to deposit float
Responsible (R): Inventory / Fixed-Asset
Accountable (A): Finance Mgr / Logistics Manager
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5076_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5076_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5076_Task7" name="Reconcile deposit float: deposits collected vs refunded vs outstanding, GL…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Reconcile deposit float: deposits collected vs refunded vs outstanding, GL liability balance (VS-17), and unclaimed-deposit handling
Responsible (R): O2C / Finance
Accountable (A): Finance Mgr
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5076_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5076_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5076_Task8" name="Audit &amp; report: internal-audit sample (VS-21), variance/shrink write-off…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Audit &amp; report: internal-audit sample (VS-21), variance/shrink write-off (VS-17.4), cylinder-lifecycle/depreciation, and the audit-evidence pack
Responsible (R): Internal Audit / Finance
Accountable (A): Finance Mgr
Duration: Audit cycle</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5076_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5076_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
