      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Monthly analytics cycle; program review
Frequency: Monthly
Volume: ~30,000–60,000-cylinder pool reconciled monthly (per the PA-175.1 &quot;10,000s&quot; pool canon)
Owner: Analytics/BI (VS-28) / Category Manager
Participants: Analytics (VS-28), Logistics (VS-06), Inventory (VS-05), FP&amp;A (VS-17.4), HSE (VS-24)
Source: workflow W5078 — Cylinder Turn, Refill Yield, Asset Utilization &amp; Leak-Rate Analytics</bpmn:documentation>
