    <bpmn:process id="W_W5080" name="W5080. LPG Program Performance, Compliance Audit &amp; ROI Analytics" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Executive review; annual strategy (W5057); compliance audit
Frequency: Quarterly/annual
Volume: 1 program × all stores
Owner: Category Manager / FP&amp;A (VS-17.4)
Participants: FP&amp;A (VS-17.4), Analytics (VS-28), HSE (VS-24), Compliance (VS-22), Internal Audit (VS-21), Strategy (VS-33)
Source: workflow W5080 — LPG Program Performance, Compliance Audit &amp; ROI Analytics</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5080_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5080_Lane1" name="FP&amp;A">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5080_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5080_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5080_Lane2" name="Analytics">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5080_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5080_Lane3" name="Category Mgr">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5080_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5080_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5080_Start5" name="Executive review; annual strategy (W5057); compliance audit">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5080_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5080_Task6" name="Measure program ROI &amp; P&amp;L: revenue, gross margin, deposit-float income…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Measure program ROI &amp; P&amp;L: revenue, gross margin, deposit-float income, operating cost, safety-incident cost, and program P&amp;L vs business case (W5057)
Responsible (R): FP&amp;A / Analytics / Category Mgr
Accountable (A): Category Mgr / CFO
Duration: Quarterly/Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5080_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5080_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5080_Task7" name="Quantify attach &amp; compliance: appliance-attach lift (grill/heater/torch)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Quantify attach &amp; compliance: appliance-attach lift (grill/heater/torch), compliance-audit findings (BFP/DOE/DTI-BPS/OSH), and incident rate
Responsible (R): Analytics / Compliance / HSE
Accountable (A): Category Mgr
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5080_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5080_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5080_Task8" name="Steer &amp; improve: site expansion/pause, pricing/yield (W5062), fleet…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Steer &amp; improve: site expansion/pause, pricing/yield (W5062), fleet right-sizing (W5059), corrective actions from audit/incidents (VS-21/VS-133), and strategy refresh (W5057)
Responsible (R): Category Mgr / Strategy / FP&amp;A
Accountable (A): Category Mgr / CFO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5080_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5080_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W5080_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W5080_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W5080_Annotation10">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-757 (ensure controlled execution — LPG Safety, Compliance, Cylinder Reconciliation &amp; Analytics (PA-175.3).) | - CTL-757: P&amp;L reconciled to FP&amp;A (VS-17.4); compliance findings remediated (VS-21/VS-133); safety-incident rate tracked; strategy refreshed annually (W5057)
Owner: Category Manager / FP&amp;A (VS-17.4)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
